# Differentiable NN primitives facade.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:nn" privata nn
# Depends on: gradus:tensor, gradus:gradient
#
# Will split into nested leaves when ≥2 primitives are implemented:
#   gradus:nn/linear       Linear (matmul + bias)
#   gradus:nn/activation   GELU, ReLU, Sigmoid, Tanh, SiLU
#   gradus:nn/norm         LayerNorm, RMSNorm
#   gradus:nn/embedding    token / position embedding lookup
#   gradus:nn/dropout      dropout (train vs eval behavior)
#
# Architectural rule: primitives do not know the architectures built from
# them. This module must not import from gradus:attention or
# gradus:transformer. Each primitive must be independently differentiable.
